    <p class="china-close__body">Tell me who's going, when, and what you want to see. I'll tell you whether the 240-hour transit or a tourist visa fits, and build the route around it.</p>
    <a href="/plan" class="btn btn--gold" data-cta="china-close-plan">Plan your China trip</a>
    <p class="china-close__fine">Rules change. Check NIA, the Chinese Embassy and your airline before you book or fly.</p>
    <p class="china-close__fine">Earned Escape is run by Chuck (Charles Betancourt), Independent Advisor, an affiliate of Castle Dreams Travel.</p>

